  "body_html": "<h1>Bid-Profile Supports</h1>\n<p>The basic auction layer includes support predicates for bid profiles and\nstrategy profiles, including nonnegativity, membership in a product set, and\nmembership in a rectangular box.</p>\n<p>It also identifies bid-profile boxes with closed intervals.</p>",
